2. **Ministry allocation rules**

   The ministry's rules are available at the following link:

   **[Rules on the minister's grants for 2024–2026 for the adoption and application of Icelandic language technology](https://island.is/stjornartidindi/nr/480d30cb-8c53-4565-93ee-7030147ad5d2)**

   The rules were published in the Government Gazette on October 16, 2024. Applicants should read them carefully and make sure their projects meet them.
